From: "Endi S. Dewata" <edewata@redhat.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Sep 2016 03:13:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Added upgrade scripts for PKI server logging service.

New upgrade scripts have been added to create a link to the default
logging.properties and to remove the unused log4j.properties in
existing instances.

https://fedorahosted.org/pki/ticket/195
---
 base/common/upgrade/10.4.0/.gitignore              |  4 ++
 base/server/upgrade/10.4.0/01-FixLoggingProperties | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 .../server/upgrade/10.4.0/02-RemoveLog4jProperties | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 94 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 base/common/upgrade/10.4.0/.gitignore
 create mode 100644 base/server/upgrade/10.4.0/01-FixLoggingProperties
 create mode 100644 base/server/upgrade/10.4.0/02-RemoveLog4jProperties

diff --git a/base/common/upgrade/10.4.0/.gitignore b/base/common/upgrade/10.4.0/.gitignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..5e7d2734cfc60289debf74293817c0a8f572ff32
--- /dev/null
+++ b/base/common/upgrade/10.4.0/.gitignore
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
